Description: brightness control for Apple displays
 Controls the brightness of Apple Cinema, Thunderbolt and Studio Displays and
 the Pro Display XDR over their USB connection, since these displays have no
 DDC/CI. Includes a command-line tool, a small GTK4 window with a slider per
 display and an on-screen brightness indicator for keyboard shortcuts.
 .
 A udev rule gives the logged-in user access to the display and hands older
 Cinema Displays to the kernel appledisplay driver.
